{"data":{"body":"[P2] Snapshot records before handing them to the worker. The queue currently retains the caller-owned record and only deep-copies it later in `exportRecord`; an end record can contain the original mutable handler result, so another thread may mutate it after the SDK serialized the execution output but before export. The insight record can therefore disagree with the durable result. Deep-copy at scheduling time and add a blocked-worker test that mutates the output after `schedule()`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7tZ6Ip","finding_digest":"56c1a4e6e5727bbddc13170496e629b54b73ca03ae600b4a8fab89210d4912ec","finding_id":"arf_v1_k3a2jzxfoj533xatc4cjnzrjwv","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exportscheduler.java::schedule::snapshot-at-enqueue","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exportscheduler.java::schedule::snapshot-at-enqueue","line":74,"observation_digest":"6137c2108f25b38c28797e7f9e6e063dd547954d54c35b18851739a6cb665c14","observation_id":"aro_v1_me34eeepewzyykdzpz7z43qghx","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/ExportScheduler.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T20:01:07Z","review_id":"arr_v1_saa42mnn4lbejfqoxbjsi46fng","reviewed_base_sha":"8505ec435fef4fae896ea5c3136272258a94ed25","reviewed_head_sha":"bad83f960de5be6acea391b0b2be4f5487e365d8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":71,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_xw3vh2ehfvvlngxiidq6g23oho"},"pull_request":{"number":703},"record_id":"art_v1_lcghtbgc2sv35vpev7ywsow2dp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T20:01:07Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
